DTEND:20250517T030500Z
DTSTAMP:20250517T010000Z
UID:mQjRXAjDEO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nCliff Curtis and Temuera Morriso
 n (both of 1994’s Once Were Warriors) star in this sweeping Māori-langu
 age epic about the 1864 Battle of Ōrākau\, as an Indigenous tribe defend
 s their land from invading British forces. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.si
 ff.net/festival/ka-whawhai-tonu-struggle-without-end\n\nAlso playing at:\n
   • Shoreline CC Theater (Sun 18 May\, 2:30 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
