 our ShortsFest Spotlight with this collection of superb films from around 
 the world: whether narrative or documentary\, live action or animation—t
 hese films prove short is truly sweet.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/sh
 ortsfest-opening-night-x39745\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
