 irkola (Dead Snow\, Violent Night). How much do you remember from sex ed? 
 Prove you didn't sleep through health class and win passes to HUMP! Part T
 wo in our trivia giveaway at the May 19 screening. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps:
 //www.siff.net/festival/spermageddon\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinem
 a Uptown House 1 (Mon 19 May\, 9:30 PM)
