DTEND:20250517T233500Z
DTSTAMP:20250517T220000Z
UID:GraNEx2uxs
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 85 mins (1h25m)\n\nJet Propulsion Laboratory scienti
 st\, robotics engineer\, and best-selling science fiction author Gentry Le
 e\, who was on NASA’s Viking and Voyager teams\, discusses his experienc
 es and views on the possibility of extraterrestrial life. Director Robert 
 Stone and cast member Gentry Lee scheduled to attend. Sponsored by:\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/festival/starman\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema 
 Uptown House 3 (Fri 16 May\, 6:00 PM)
