UID:INJl9fQN9R
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nAnnapurna Sriram writes\, direct
 s\, and stars in this campy\, vividly pastel-colored romp about a woman wh
 o embarks upon a sex worker odyssey through Trashtown with her nonbinary f
 riend to break a terrible curse that has befallen her. SXSW Special Jury P
 rize winner. Director Annapurna Sriram scheduled to attend. Keep your biza
 rre odyssey through queer cinema going with a chance to win tickets to the
  Queer & Trans Film Festival at the screening on May 16. Sponsored by:\n\n
 https://www.siff.net/festival/fucktoys\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cin
 ema Uptown House 1 (Fri 16 May\, 9:30 PM)
LOCATION:AMC Pacific Place 11\, 600 Pine Street
END:VEVENT
