 ius Meredith Monk approaches her final project\, the immersive “Indra’
 s Net\,” she and her greatest protégés and collaborators relive and re
 interpret her storied career’s most enduring works. Director Billy Sheba
 r scheduled to attend. Attend the May 16 screening for a chance to win goo
 die bags from Hex Enduction Records & Books! Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/festival/monk-in-pieces\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Up
 town House 2 (Fri 16 May\, 3:00 PM)
