BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Idyllic
DTSTART:20250518T224500Z
DTEND:20250519T003500Z
DTSTAMP:20250518T224500Z
UID:vbHhTPyBqT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nThis vibrant and witty meditation
  on death and discontent tracks three generations of one Dutch family as t
 hey contend with all the various curveballs life throws at them. But in th
 eir own respective way\, each extended family member just wants the same t
 hing: a happy life. Director Aaron Rookus scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://
 www.siff.net/festival/idyllic\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • AMC Pacific Place
  11 (Sat 17 May\, 9:30 PM)
LOCATION:AMC Pacific Place 11\, 600 Pine Street
END:VEVENT
