 nfolds like a horror film\, as three French journalists in 1978 Cambodia l
 earn the terrible truth about the Khmer Rouge regime. Learn about the Eliz
 abeth Becker Cambodia and Khmer Rouge Collection from UW Associate Profess
 or of Sociocultural Anthropology Jenna Grant at the May 18 screening. Spon
