 1’s Truman & Tennessee: An Intimate Conversation) constructs an astonish
 ing portrait of polymath Jean Cocteau—filmmaker\, playwright\, poet—to
 ld in his own words using his journals\, letters\, and artistic works. Pro
 ducer/Editor John Northrup scheduled to attend. Come early to the May 20 s
 creening to find out about ACT Contemporary Theatre's upcoming production 
