 nies like Google and Facebook at the cost of everybody else…and democrac
 y itself. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/unclickable\n\nAl
 so playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3 (Thu 22 May\, 1:30 PM)\n\
 nFilm is also being streamed.
