BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:She’s The He
DTSTART:20250520T040000Z
DTEND:20250520T053500Z
DTSTAMP:20250520T040000Z
UID:XgrP0rvfhH
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 81 mins (1h21m)\n\nFirst-time director Siobhan McCar
 thy put together a cast and crew of almost entirely trans\, nonbinary\, an
 d queer people to make this Bottoms-esque teen satire about two seniors wh
 o pretend to be trans during their last week of high school\, only for one
  of them to find it suits them just fine. Director Siobhan McCarthy\, prod
 ucer Vic Brandt\, and producer Halley Albert scheduled to attend. Keep the
  cinematic trans hijinks going with a chance to win tickets to the Queer &
  Trans Film Festival at the May 19 screening. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www
 .siff.net/festival/shes-the-he\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • AMC Pacific Plac
 e 11 (Tue 20 May\, 3:30 PM)\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Khartoum
DTSTART:20250520T043000Z
DTEND:20250520T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20250520T043000Z
UID:u5dCkQgv91
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 80 mins (1h20m)\n\nThe Sudanese Civil War has displa
 ced over 10 million of its citizens. Now\, five survivors contend with the
 ir own memories\, and hope for a peaceful future\, using green screen tech
 nology to reenact their lives leading up to the military coup that forced 
 their evacuation. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/khartoum\
 n\nAlso playing at:\n  • AMC Pacific Place 11 (Wed 21 May\, 1:30 PM)
LOCATION:AMC Pacific Place 11\, 600 Pine Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spermageddon
DTSTART:20250520T043000Z
DTEND:20250520T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20250520T043000Z
UID:r97Vb8gTHO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 80 mins (1h20m)\n\nIn this raunchy yet sincere anima
 ted adult musical about the beginning of life\, Simon must lead a squad of
  fellow semen on a high-stakes mission to achieve fertilization and defeat
  the nefarious Jizzmo from enacting Spermageddon! From co-director Tommy W
 irkola (Dead Snow\, Violent Night). How much do you remember from sex ed? 
 Prove you didn't sleep through health class and win passes to HUMP! Part T
 wo in our trivia giveaway at the May 19 screening. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps:
 //www.siff.net/festival/spermageddon\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinem
 a Downtown (Fri 16 May\, 11:59 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Viktor
DTSTART:20250520T043000Z
DTEND:20250520T061000Z
DTSTAMP:20250520T043000Z
UID:YN7LIxdx1B
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 89 mins (1h29m)\n\nWhen Russia invaded Ukraine\, Vik
 tor Korotovskyi rallied to join the military but was rejected due to his d
 eafness. Instead\, he became a war photographer. Join Viktor on the frontl
 ines in this wholly immersive and terrifying documentary from producer Dar
 ren Aronofsky. Attend the May 17 screening for a chance to win a book of s
 tunning Ukrainian photography\, courtesy of Ukraine Defense Support. Spons
 ored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/viktor\n\nAlso playing at:\n  
 • SIFF Cinema Downtown (Sat 17 May\, 2:30 PM)\n\nFilm is also being stre
 amed.
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
