UID:joC9jNrBmv
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nIn this sincere and impeccably ar
 t-directed Wes Anderson-esque film based on Christophe Boltanski’s memoi
 r “La Cache\,” a nine-year-old boy and his quirky\, artistic family ex
 perience the turbulence of 1968 Paris from the relative safety of their mu
 ltigenerational home. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-s
 afe-house\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Shoreline CC Theater (Thu 22 May\, 6:
 00 PM)
