 ll be a carefree summer chilling out on their Dublin housing estate turns 
 more complicated when they push toward an adulthood they are ill-prepared 
 for in Claire Frances Byrne’s debut feature. Director Claire Frances Byr
 ne scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/ready-or-not\n\nA
 lso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2 (Wed 21 May\, 9:30 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
