UID:ClUjIqsmTX
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nGuinean immigrant Souleymane has 
 applied for asylum in France. Soon he’ll have an interview with the gove
 rnment agency that will change his life…if only he can figure out the ri
 ght story to tell. This film is generously sponsored by Mike Weidemann in 
 memory of Tove Lund and Bruce Hawley. Also sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.si
 ff.net/festival/souleymanes-story\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema D
 owntown (Sat 24 May\, 12:00 PM)\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
