  from James Sweeney (2019’s crowdpleasing Straight Up)\, two men (Dylan 
 O’Brien and Sweeney) trauma-bond at a support group for people who have 
 lost their twin. Winner of the Sundance 2025 US Dramatic Audience Award. D
 irector James Sweeney scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festiv
 al/twinless\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3 (Sun 25 
 May\, 7:15 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
