 his supernatural chiller\, Indy (the goodest boy of all!) is all that stan
 ds between his human best friend and the dark forces that haunt their rura
 l family home. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/good-boy\n\n
 Also playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2 (Sun 25 May\, 7:30 PM)
